        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana K4473, Colonial American Cabinet Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade of solid brass, this 3\" center to center Colonial American style pull handle is great for cabinets, drawers, furniture or small utility type doors. Packaged complete with screws for easy installation. Available in 8 decorative finishes so you will be sure to find just what you are looking for. The simple design will add subtle beauty to your cabinets. The perfect way to redecorate your kitchen without spending a lot of money.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/deltana-K4473-size.gif?v=1704354560\" width=\"433\" height=\"182\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana K4473 Colonial American Cabinet Pull Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/4-inch-colonial-american-cabinet-handle-deltana-k4474\"><b>4\" Colonial American Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana K4473 Colonial American Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 3-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 3\" c.c.</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/K4473.pdf?v=1704262159\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana K4473 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose, the cabinet handle will still be <b>high quality solid brass</b>. \r\n</p>",
